  newUnique, newOp.

Shared state to guard:
  S1  Funcdata::obank (PcodeOpBank: alive/dead, opcode index, alloc)
  S2  Funcdata::vbank (VarnodeBank: def map, location map, alloc)
  S3  Funcdata::*ModCount counters (4 uint8 fields)
