  newExtendedConstant, newOpBefore, newIndirectOp/Creation,
  opSetAllInput, opUnlink, opDestroyRaw, opDestroyRecursive,
  opInsertBefore/After/Begin/End.  These either go through wrapped
  helpers (opInsertBefore→opInsert) or are off the scope_op_only hot
